[I] Column-oriented database management system

[T] MonetDB is a high-performance, column-oriented database system for
[T] query-intensive applications such as data warehousing and analytics,
[T] originally developed by the CWI database research group. It supports SQL
[T] with a vectorized execution engine and is available under the Mozilla
[T] Public License 2.0.

[U] https://www.monetdb.org/

